            "id": "/mycc.md/setup",
            "text": "Refer to `README.md` for instructions. Prefer pnpm instead of npm. The only exception is `npm link` to install the mycc globally.\n\n**Cross-Platform Notes (Windows / PowerShell):** mycc runs on Windows, Linux, and macOS. On Windows, all `bash` tool commands execute via **PowerShell** (not cmd) — use `Get-Content file`, `Copy-Item src dest`, concatenate with `;` not `&&`, escape with backtick `` ` ``. Set `PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8` for Python subprocesses; write operations use explicit `utf-8` encoding; the bash tool prepends `[Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8` for CJK display. Always use forward slashes `/` in tool file paths (`normalizePathSeparators` handles `\\` → `/` before regex matching). `/fork` uses `PowerShell -EncodedCommand` to spawn terminals (avoids `wt.exe` semicolon bugs; `shell:true` removed, paths single-quoted). `psmux` replaces `tmux` on Windows (`winget install psmux`). Binary detection uses `Where.exe`/`Get-Command` instead of `which`. GUI editor spawn does not use `windowsHide` (prevents freezing).",
            "title": "Setup",
            "summary": "## Setup\n\nInstallation instructions live in **QUICKSTART.md** (README.md defers to it): `git clone`, `pnpm install`, then the single npm exception `npm link` (installs the `bin/mycc.js` CLI globally and enables type imports for custom tools). `package.json` is `\"private\": true` — `@pkubangbang/mycc` is never on npm. Prereqs: Node ≥18; native deps (`sharp`, `@lancedb/lancedb`, `ripgrep`) ship prebuilt, build tools only when needed. Then `ollama pull nomic-embed-text` (embedding model required), optional tmux (`winget install psmux` on Windows, for `hand_over`), and `mycc --setup` writing `~/.mycc-store/.env` or `./.mycc/.env` (`src/setup/paths.ts`).\n\n**Windows/PowerShell:** the bash tool never uses cmd — `src/utils/shell-detect.ts` picks pwsh7 (`MYCC_PWSH`, PATH, Program Files) or PS 5.1 once at startup and spawns `-NoProfile -NonInteractive -EncodedCommand` (Base64 UTF-16LE) with a UTF-8 preamble (`chcp 65001`, `[Console]::OutputEncoding`), `PYTHONUTF8`/`PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8`, plus `PS51_LAYER2_PATCH` (no-BOM writes, UTF-8 `Get-Content`). `src/loop/agent-exec.ts` filters CLIXML noise; `src/loop/prompt-populators.ts` injects syntax guidance (Get-Content/Copy-Item, `;` vs `&&`, backtick escaping, forward slashes). `/fork` (src/slashes/fork.ts) uses `-EncodedCommand` to dodge wt.exe's `;` bug. GUI editors skip `windowsHide` (src/utils/open-editor.ts). Caveat: code uses `where ollama`, and `normalizePathSeparators` does not exist in `src/`.",
