                    "comment": "BackgroundTasks (ctx.bg) behind bg_create/bg_print/bg_await/bg_remove — spawn + unref(), output tail-capped at MAX_OUTPUT_BYTES=100KB, 'killed' distinct from 'failed', killAllRunning() at shutdown."
                  },
